  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malawi - District Water Supply Project II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Malawi - Projet d&apos;approvisionnement en eau des districts II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the project is to alleviate the existing water shortages in the two urban centres of Kasungu and Mzuzu, by providing an adequate potable water supply for each of the two centres to meet their water demands up to the year 2000, and prepare a water supply project for 13 other centres.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR"></narrative>
  </description>
